entries[20034] = { ["name"] = "Enchant Weapon - Crusader", ["text"] = "5 sec cast\nTools: Runed Arcanite Rod\nReagents:\nLarge Brilliant Shard (4), Righteous Orb (2)\nPermanently enchant a melee weapon so that often when attacking in melee it heals for 75 to 125 and increases Strength by 100 for 15 sec. Has a reduced effect for players above level 60." }
